{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "residential",
  "conversations": {
    "residential_arrival": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ra_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ra_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "街上的房子还在背后。再往里一点，听见自己走路，听不见街了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ra_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "滑梯下面空着，滑道的出口倒正对着长椅。等孩子下来的人坐那里不用转头。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "residential_arrived",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.residential"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "residential_arrived",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "顺街到了居民院。滑梯朝着一张空长椅，楼间有条窄路。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ra_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "长椅上没人。楼跟楼之间还留了条窄路，从这边能看见尽头的亮处。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "residential_stair": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "rs_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "rs_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "扶手拐了个弯。站在这儿，能看到的就到平台。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "up",
              "text": "从这里数到平台。",
              "next": "rs_up_1"
            },
            {
              "id": "down",
              "text": "先走平路。",
              "next": "rs_down_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rs_up_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "数到上头才发觉，刚才把平台也算成一级了。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "residential_loop_stair",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "院里的楼梯从下方只能数到第一处平台。没有上去。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rs_up_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "再数也只能到那儿。要知道上面有什么，得真的走上去。",
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "rs_down_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "不数了。两栋楼中间，平着也有路。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "animal_sighting": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "a_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "a_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "花坛的阴面有块绿。一抬起来，才看见跟下面的影子不是一回事。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "animal_seen",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.animal"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "animal_seen",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你在花坛边的水泥地上看见一只绿色的动物。你说不出那是什么。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "它不远。只要不盯着它看，几乎可以当成花坛掉下来的一块。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "closer",
              "text": "仔细看它的头。",
              "next": "a_c_1"
            },
            {
              "id": "stay",
              "text": "先别惊动它。",
              "next": "a_s_1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_c_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "看过去，先对上的是眼睛。它把头转过来了，身子没动。"
        },
        {
          "id": "a_c_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "嘴是扁的，尾巴也是。看不清尾巴在地上，还是离地一点。",
          "next": "a_recall",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "animal_bill_seen",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "这只绿色的动物有扁扁的嘴和扁扁的尾巴。别的都说不清。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_s_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "先认地上那道缝。它还没越过去。"
        },
        {
          "id": "a_s_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "等了一会儿，影子倒比刚才清楚。它把头抬得更高了。",
          "next": "a_recall"
        },
        {
          "id": "a_recall",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "课本里那张图倒想起来了。图底下一行小字，只记得它排得很短。",
          "source": "recalled",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "animal_recall",
              "source": "recalled",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "想起课本里一幅图和它下面很短的图注。记不清写的是什么。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a_end",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "算了，先别给它填那个名字。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "animal_again": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "aa_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "aa_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "又看到那一点绿。这次先看见的是影子。"
        },
        {
          "id": "aa_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "还说不上是哪一种。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
